    <tags>komboe password manager cli</tags>
    <summary>Komboe is an open-source, zero-knowledge password manager for families and teams.</summary>
    <description>
Komboe is an open-source, zero-knowledge password manager for families and teams.

Store passwords, passkeys, 2FA codes, secure notes and cards in an end-to-end encrypted vault. Your vault is encrypted on your device before it is synced; the server never receives your master password or vault keys.

- Password generator and autofill
- Passkeys and TOTP codes
- Secure sharing with family members and teams, with groups and roles
- Email aliases
- Self-hostable server

Komboe is based on Vaultwarden and Bitwarden clients and is not affiliated with or endorsed by Bitwarden Inc. or the Vaultwarden project. Source code: https://github.com/GoDeskio/Komboe
    </description>
